  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "17歲ê酸甘甜"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>張苡薰</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">春天ê花蕊恬恬leh開</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">隔壁班ê查埔bih tī hia偷偷仔看--你</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">怎樣是啥人koh愛--你</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lóng煞煞--去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">想空想縫mā無法--伊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit个不管時心肝ē phi̍h-pho̍k-tshíng ê年紀</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">實在有淡薄仔古錐</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">看著夢中ê伊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有微微仔歡喜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ng-ng-iap-iap ê感情</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">講bē出喙</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄-koh我猶原tī tsia kah意--你</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">運動埕飄撇ê姿勢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hōo我看kah迷迷迷</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">啊！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">伊雄雄越頭kā我看</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我suah一下仔gāng--去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">總算知影</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">原來tse就是青春ê滋味</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">17歲ê酸甘甜</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEitm5yoCVJRv2mqRaHhg2f3p_2K56pK1qqm-0sp5fx-gh3uVpWe2jx9XDHHMmtdBefE-pjHR5lznVu-fWuEXv9QLQpBNLs_gWHbUYnlwaDvd9Rn6XKGxWwFE3GhPGQXs2qacdx8AVpEdd0WTnA35I-Jt0nJwJmzvbaEIwrEh1oGZlY5HJ0mjdOSBnY5OtFk/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1372%E6%9C%9F_4.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEitm5yoCVJRv2mqRaHhg2f3p_2K56pK1qqm-0sp5fx-gh3uVpWe2jx9XDHHMmtdBefE-pjHR5lznVu-fWuEXv9QLQpBNLs_gWHbUYnlwaDvd9Rn6XKGxWwFE3GhPGQXs2qacdx8AVpEdd0WTnA35I-Jt0nJwJmzvbaEIwrEh1oGZlY5HJ0mjdOSBnY5OtFk/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1372%E6%9C%9F_4.jpg\" width=\"458\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a name='more'></a><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjv7shiEFWTCy9-wJIrUfe2CSgce8igCpw_wTlmDlLw2Ta2bQbmvtjau5Z6EmJCk9V2_7FGFDItDdagbmVRMJDo__tGZhJMkd2ZR0BuvdmMs04hAAb08Cgk8vs0aExzyAHp6wKPcdN5OTHnXNOXZHTM0Bvd0PHQzafyBTCiTqsJRH_deNaIAVM10GwjptvT/s1424/372%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjv7shiEFWTCy9-wJIrUfe2CSgce8igCpw_w